ignment:start;--font-size:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation:unset;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation-medium-up:unset"><p><span style="font-weight:700">Step 3</span><span> From the email or social editor, choose Add from Canva, select a design, and start sending or publishing.</span></p></span></div><span class="_8aVEnQ" style="--FnDW1g:4px" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></div><div class="Glaia0B" style="--alignment:center;--alignment-small-up:start;--direction:column;--direction-small-up:row"><a href="https://login.constantcontact.com/login/login.sdo?goto=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.constantcontact.com%2Fprocessing_login.jsp%3FOriginalURL%3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fapp.constantcontact.com%2Fpages%2Fintegrations%2Flanding%2Fcanva&amp;partner_name=ROVING" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="_5KtATA Xj0kcw LQzFZw VgvqkQ _8ERLTg Z3nT2A LQzFZw VgvqkQ _4_iekA j34Zww aqbYPg _3FvZZg"><span class="khPe7Q">Connect Constant Contact</span><span id="_R_jqept6_"><span class="_pFsfA">(opens in a new tab or window)</span></span></a><a href="https://knowledgebase.constantcontact.com/email-digital-marketing/tutorials/KnowledgeBase/41610-Insert-Canva-images-into-your-campaigns?lang=en_US" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="_5KtATA Xj0kcw LQzFZw VgvqkQ _8ERLTg unS_Qw LQzFZw VgvqkQ _4_iekA j34Zww aqbYPg _3FvZZg"><span class="khPe7Q">Get help</span><span id="_R_lqept6_"><span class="_pFsfA">(opens in a new tab or window)</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="A7kraOt _zF40u8 xaYl_HI Y1TxiMR"><div class="_4-gPR6y"><div class="cGFigur" style="--gradient-default:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(199, 215, 255, 1) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 1) 100%)"></div><div class="JwqgN84 BMOCzQ _6Mu4Ow MYb60A LuBWVA" style="--s_rwAw:flex"><div class="AzTaUhE"><div class="theme light cc24 pgwnrjs" style="--alignment:auto"><div c