ze:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*24);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*32);--font-variation:&quot;opsz&quot; 100;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*32);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*42);--font-variation-medium-up:&quot;opsz&quot; 100">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="iRrBvK- TAzQBcu"><ul class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw:24px" role="list"><li aria-hidden="true"><hr class="_PhRSQ"/></li><li class="TV2qbA BMOCzQ LuBWVA"><div role="heading" aria-level="3"><button id="_R_12qmpt6_" type="button" class="PuABGQ YRzkuA BMOCzQ XxpeBg fOwrSw EC2pjw _6Mu4Ow LuBWVA uMo6Kw YnfReg vFBXLA" style="--s_rwAw:block;--TPsgaw:8px;--Wk647Q:4px;--4FjUhQ:var(--0iDYqA)" aria-controls="_R_12qmpt6H1_" aria-expanded="true"><span class="Ka9auQ" style="--PmK0MA:8px;--TPF5Nw:center"><span class="aDc6Yg" style="--djlACw:1 1 0%"><p class="qXoAGw aZskFA T5LNnw">What is the Canva for Constant Contact app?</p></span><span class="aDc6Yg" style="--djlACw:0 0 auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="_6XqXLQ Pk6ZMQ"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path fill="currentColor" d="m7.621 14.783 4.202-4.202a.25.25 0 0 1 .354 0l4.201 4.202a.75.75 0 1 0 1.06-1.06l-4.2-4.203a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-2.476 0l-4.201 4.202a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06"/></svg></span></span></span></button></div><div class="BMOCzQ EC2pjw _6Mu4Ow LuBWVA" style="--s_rwAw:block;--TPsgaw:8px;--KtVHvQ:16px" role="region" id="_R_12qmpt6H1_" aria-labelledby="_R_12qmpt6_"><span class="_6LuO_x2 qcm1mUj I2jq234 XhK5Vs8 s7iDOpk" style="--alignment:start;--font-size:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation:unset;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation-medium-up:unset"><p><span>The Canva for Constant Contact app integrates your Canva and Constant Contact accounts, so you can bring your designs directly into your email and social campaigns without downloading or reformatting files.</span></p></span></div></li><li aria-hidden="true"><hr class="_PhRSQ"/></li><li class="TV2qbA BMOCzQ LuBWVA"><div role="heading" aria-level="3"><button id="_R_14qmpt6_" type="button" class="PuABGQ YRzkuA BMOCzQ XxpeBg fOwrSw EC2pjw _6Mu4Ow LuBWVA uMo6Kw YnfReg vFBXLA" style="--s_rwAw:block;--TPsgaw:8px;--Wk647Q:4px;--4FjUhQ:var(--0iDYqA)" aria-controls="_R_14qmpt6H1_" aria-expanded="false"><span class="Ka9auQ" style="--PmK0MA:8px;--TPF5Nw:center"><span class="aDc6Yg" style="--djlACw:1 1 0%"><p class="qXoAGw aZskFA T5LNnw">What can I do with the Canva for Constant Contact app?</p></span><span class="aDc6Yg" style="--djlACw:0 0 auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="_6XqXLQ Pk6ZMQ"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path fill="currentColor" d="m16.384 9.225-4.207 4.207a.25.25 0 0 1-.353 0L7.623 9.224a.75.75 0 0 0-1.059.002.75.75 0 0 0-.002 1.059l4.201 4.21c.681.68 1.787.678 2.47-.005l4.207-4.207a.75.75 0 0 0 .002-1.059.75.75 0 0 0-1.058.002"/></svg></span></span></span></button></div><div class="BMOCzQ EC2pjw _6Mu4Ow LuBWVA" style="--s_rwAw:none;--TPsgaw:8px;--KtVHvQ:16px" role="region" id="_R_14qmpt6H1_" aria-labelledby="_R_14qmpt6_"><span class="_6LuO_x2 qcm1mUj I2jq234 XhK5Vs8 s7iDOpk" style="--alignment:start;--font-size:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation:unset;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation-medium-up:unset"><p><span>Create designs in Canva and instantly sync them to Constant Contact. Use your polished designs in emails, social posts, landing pages, and ads. Publish and track performance in one place.</span></p></span></div></li><li aria-hidden="true"><hr class="_PhRSQ"/></li><li class="TV2qbA BMOCzQ LuBWVA"><div role="heading" aria-level="3"><button id="_R